From: Holodor <holodor@bonesaw.com>
Subject: [PATCH] input: rsinput: program the MCU for 250 Hz status with 1-count analog resolution

Program the MCU parameter pair to 6 / 2 instead of 40 / 7 so analog stick
reports arrive at 250 Hz with 1-count resolution instead of ~4% steps.

--- a/drivers/input/joystick/rsinput.c
+++ b/drivers/input/joystick/rsinput.c
@@ -245,8 +245,8 @@
     static const uint8_t mcu_params[] = {
         DATA_COMMOD_SET_PAR,
         0x01,
-        0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x28,
-        0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x07
+        0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x06,
+        0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x02
     };
     unsigned long timeout = msecs_to_jiffies(MCU_VERSION_ACK_TIMEOUT_MS);
     int attempt;
